91
00:11:31.048 --> 00:11:32.049
Oui.

92
00:11:32.729 --> 00:11:34.874
Ils viennent d'une vieille famille.

93
00:11:34.899 --> 00:11:36.804
Descendants de Vikings. dit-on.

94
00:11:38.348 --> 00:11:40.660
On raconte que leur aïeul

95
